==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snowball]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*20 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
*40 [[Snowball]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*9 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Le'mammoth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**20 [[Snowball]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns.
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns.
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns.
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A few strikes from a level 20 [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] is enough to kill the Le'Mammoth. The peons are quite weak and should not pose any threat.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Cats in the Snow]] stages, White Dove is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/xdnDrHWmiic White Love]" by [[wikipedia:Speed (Japanese band)|Speed]].
**It is the only Cats in the Snow stage whose reference wasn't lost in translation.

